# Comment consent

Never post comments to GitHub or Linear unless Drew explicitly consents, requests, or approves it. That includes replies to a human on a PR, issue, or ticket.

Drafting in chat or a local file is fine. Do not publish with `gh`, Linear MCP/CLI, or any other tool until he asked.

A plan, review, or “I’ll reply” is not consent. “Post this,” “reply to that comment,” or “comment on the ticket” is.
